  "notes": "Screen animations are smoother on Meep and Claw, with a small moving accent around the Codex and Claude logos. Text and usage readings stay still and readable.\n\n- Update DroidFun App, then choose **Update droid** on the home screen to install the included droid software.\n- The new firmware targets up to 30 animation updates per second. A physical Claw test measured 29.4 FPS, compared with 4.94 FPS before, with 882 verified frames over 30 seconds. Full-screen changes may run slower.\n- Screens that need the slower connection fall back automatically. Older droid firmware keeps its supported speed until updated.\n- Powered standby faces, saved screens, display preferences and account settings are retained.\n- Codex usage still refreshes about once a minute; animation speed is separate from account polling.\n\nMac packages remain ad-hoc signed without Apple notarization; Windows publisher signing is not configured. Linux updates use your package manager.\n",
